# Halo loop

Ask → harvest beads into **Keep** (not due, in progress) → when due they sit on **Home** → tap a chip for a **round** (SEE all, then SAY all) → gold leaves the dock for the Cove-right badge.

- **Keep (header beads) = not due, not gold.** Cap 30 in-progress. Do not scatter these on Home.
- Sort Keep **silver → bronze → new** (Cove toward the right). Chrono within a rank (older left, newer right). New harvests grow on the right of the new band.
- Rank is a **3px inset metal rim** on kind color (`box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 3px`). Do not use `border`. Do not gray bands. Do not resize beads.
- **Home = due.** Individual chips, 16 seats. Click one to play its **cluster round**. Day cap **2 rounds**.
- Harvest lands in Keep, not on the Home field.
- Due drops the other way — bead leaves Keep and grows into its Home seat.
- Gold: fade out of the dock; badge right of Cove. No harvest-style flight.
- Play-bank / due-drop flights are loop motion. Harvest flight and Home↔chat composer morph stay as they are. Do not retune harvest z-index 120.
- Play sheet stays `var(--halo-chat)` (~832px). Inner column ~440px. Spec: `web/HALO-V2-SUNDAY.md`.
- Paper/mixer polish and Home chip **seating** are frozen unless Camron files a Replay of a ship-blocker.
- Lab `/preview` only until he says promote. Family `/ask` stays frozen.
- Persist Keep in `web/src/lib/keep-memory.ts`. Lab Mix → Loop walks the Mix proof in the Sunday spec.
